<h1>United MileagePlus Miles Value Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Estimate the travel purchasing power of your United MileagePlus miles. Choose an illustrative valuation benchmark or input a custom cents-per-mile assumption to evaluate your mileage portfolio.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  United MileagePlus miles do not possess a fixed cash value because United utilizes dynamic award pricing without fixed award charts. For educational planning, this calculator provides illustrative scenarios from 1.0¢ to 1.5¢ per mile. These are modeling assumptions selected by this site, not official United valuations, live award prices, or guaranteed redemption values. To estimate your portfolio's travel purchasing power, multiply your mileage balance by your estimated cents-per-mile assumption and divide by 100.
</div>

